OL,3,GNEWSARace schedule brought forward due
OL,4,Ato expected rain
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Manx Grand Prix and Classic TT
OL,7,Fraces will come to an end three days
OL,8,Fearlier than planned due to a forecast
OL,9,Fof wet and windy weather.
OL,11,FOrganisers said they had to implement
OL,12,F"a susbstantially revised schedule" due
OL,13,Fto the forecast for later in the week.
OL,15,FThe closing day has been brought
OL,16,Fforward to Tuesday rather than Friday
OL,17,F"following detailed consideration", an
OL,18,Fevent spokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
