OL,3,GNEWSARace schedule brought forward due
OL,4,Ato expected rain
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis was done "to make the best use of
OL,7,Fthe more favourable conditions
OL,8,Fcurrently forecast between Saturday and
OL,9,FTuesday, providing the strongest
OL,10,Favailable opportunity to complete the
OL,11,Fremaining Manx Grand Prix and Classic
OL,12,FTT races", they said.
